    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_03",
      "hash64": "20DD922EF5E4DE1B",
      "text": "Capito cosa?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_04",
      "hash64": "20DD972EF5E4E69A",
      "text": "Potresti spiegarti meglio?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_07",
      "hash64": "3628B3A5496FDD00",
      "text": "Ah, perdonami... Devo ancora riprendermi\\ndallo spavento.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_08",
      "hash64": "3628C2A5496FF67D",
      "text": "Sai, i ragazzi del team hanno da poco ripreso\\nad andare a scuola...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_09",
      "hash64": "3628C1A5496FF4CA",
      "text": "Ero preoccupata per loro, quindi sono venuta\\na controllare che riuscissero a integrarsi...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_01",
      "hash64": "65304FA143DF53AA",
      "text": "Come immaginavo, non siamo ancora\\ni benvenuti, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_01",
      "hash64": "1D3B2C79154455C0",
      "text": "Che ci vuoi fare...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_02",
      "hash64": "1D3B2F7915445AD9",
      "text": "Avremo pure risolto il malinteso con gli\\ninsegnanti...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_03",
      "hash64": "1D3B2E7915445926",
      "text": "Ma non possiamo di certo aspettarci che tutti ci\\naccolgano a braccia aperte come se nulla fosse.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_02",
      "hash64": "65304EA143DF51F7",
      "text": "Non hai tutti i torti. Qui non ci resta che\\ncambiare strategia.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_10",
      "hash64": "3625B4A5496DA8DC",
      "text": "Cambiare strategia...? Forse hanno intenzione\\ndi indossare l’uniforme standard, invece di quella\\r\\nche hanno modificato...?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_11",
      "hash64": "3625B5A5496DAA8F",
      "text": "Romi... Orty...\\nSiete disposti a tanto pur di ambientarvi...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_04",
      "hash64": "1D3B317915445E3F",
      "text": "E cosa vorresti fare, di preciso?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_03",
      "hash64": "65304DA143DF5044",
      "text": "Eh? Beh, uhm...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_04",
      "hash64": "65304CA143DF4E91",
      "text": "Potremmo provare con un saluto a tutto volume,\\nche ne dici?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_05",
      "hash64": "1D3B307915445C8C",
      "text": "Cosa?! Ma che ti passa per la testa?!\\nNon ci pensare nemmeno, mi rifiuto![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_12",
      "hash64": "3625B6A5496DAC42",
      "text": "Eh...? Forse mi sbagliavo...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_05",
      "hash64": "65304BA143DF4CDE",
      "text": "Prima di decidere ascoltami un attimo, Ortiz.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_06",
      "hash64": "65304AA143DF4B2B",
      "text": "Ai concerti di Lima lei fa così, per esempio.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_07",
      "hash64": "653049A143DF4978",
      "text": "Se l’atmosfera non è calda, per prima cosa\\nsaluta tutti urlando a squarciagola...\\c\\nÈ l’ideale per sciogliere un po’ il pubblico![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_06",
      "hash64": "1D3B3379154461A5",
      "text": "Sì, magari a un concerto! Vorrei ricordarti\\nche qui siamo a scuola.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_08",
      "hash64": "653048A143DF47C5",
      "text": "Quindi a te sta bene non fare nulla e continuare\\na essere evitato?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_07",
      "hash64": "1D3B327915445FF2",
      "text": "C-Certo che no, che domande...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_09",
      "hash64": "653047A143DF4612",
      "text": "Allora non ci resta che tirare fuori la voce,\\nnon pensi? Forza, ora o mai più...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_10",
      "hash64": "652CCAA143DC3BD4",
      "text": "BUONGIORNO A TUTTIII!!!\\nOGGI È UNA SPLENDIDA GIORNATA!!![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_08",
      "hash64": "1D3B35791544650B",
      "text": "Romelio, piantala! Mi stai mettendo in\\nimbarazzo![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_11",
      "hash64": "652CCBA143DC3D87",
      "text": "È UN PIACERE INCONTRARVI!!!\\nDai Ortiz, di’ qualcosa anche tu![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_09",
      "hash64": "1D3B347915446358",
      "text": "Non coinvolgermi! Poi scommetto che hai solo\\nvoglia di fare chiasso, ammettilo![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_12",
      "hash64": "652CCCA143DC3F3A",
      "text": "VI AUGURO UNA BUONA SERATA!!!\\nForza, veloce, tocca a te![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_10",
      "hash64": "1D37C7791541744A",
      "text": "V-VI AUGURO UNA BUONA SERATA![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
